	(text "Copied from the Radxa Rock 5B v1.45 schematic, sheet 22. Rail names are the reference's.\nVCC4V0_SYS (4.0 V system rail) and VCC_1V1_NLDO_S3 come from regulators that are not drawn yet.\nBucks 1-5 are sensed at the processor: each VOUT pin goes to a <rail>_FB net with 100R to the local\noutput; the sense net must be tied to the rail at the processor balls (net tie, not drawn yet).\nBuck 6 and 9 dividers are the LPDDR4/4X values (1.1 V and 0.6 V); LPDDR5 needs 110K and a 0R/open pair.\nJ (3-pin header): short pin 1 to 2 for the power button, pin 3 to 2 for reset."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 15 0)
